<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Take me, Best Love, O take me!</l><l>Thy compassion now sway</l><l>My heart, will, and emotion;</l><l>Burn all the idols away.</l><l>Burn, burn, burn, burn,</l><l>Burn all the idols away.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Guard me in Thine affection;</l><l>Keep me simple and chaste.</l><l>None beside Thee in heaven,</l><l>None on earth long we to taste.</l><l>Jesus only! None on earth long we to taste.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Time takes moment by moment</l><l>Our hearts closer each day</l><l>To Thee; Lord, we beseech Thee:</l><l>Quickly come, even today!</l><l>Amen, Jesus, quickly come, even today!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
